  "answer_text": "Good news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not an upcoming episode.\n\nThe episode number depends on the airing order used, but here are the two most common versions:\n\n1. **\"Gorizilla\"** \u2013 Season 2, Episode 12 aired on **May 13, 2018**. In this episode, Adrien's bodyguard gets akumatized into Gorizilla, who, endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell, tracks Adrien all through Paris.\n\n2. **\"Sapotis\"** \u2013 According to the official Miraculous website, as Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters, twins Etta and Ella, won't stop making mischief. When Alya punishes them, the twins get akumatized by Hawk Moth and become Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city.\n\nThe episode listing can vary depending on the region and platform (Netflix, Disney+, etc.), since the show airs in about 150 countries, each with its own order of episodes.\n\nEither way, both episodes have long since aired. You can watch them now on streaming platforms like Disney+!",
